      "content": "we tried boosting the temp and the pressure like you suggested but it didnt help much. the ink just seems to vanish or get patchy during the press. it's like the color is being sucked out of the paper before it even hits the fabric. is there any chance it's a chemical reaction issue or something else interfering with the transfer?",
